{"ticker":"CSX","updated":"2026-10-30T22:42:35Z","profile":{"longName":"CSX Corporation","shortName":"CSX Corporation","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Railroads","country":"United States","website":"https://www.csx.com","fullTimeEmployees":21900,"marketCap":96310173696,"trailingPE":27.078127,"forwardPE":22.221464,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":6.445601,"pegRatio":1.86,"targetMeanPrice":53.80739,"targetHighPrice":60.0,"targetLowPrice":32.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":23,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.12,"earningsGrowth":0.538,"grossMargins":0.47777998,"operatingMargins":0.39258,"profitMargins":0.23966,"totalRevenue":14942000128,"beta":1.203,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":53.6,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":33.63,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":1.07},"summary":"CSX Corporation, together with its subsidiaries, provides rail-based freight transportation services in the United States and Canada. It operates through two segments: rail and trucking. The company offers rail services; and transportation of intermodal containers and trailers, as well as other transportation services, such as rail-to-truck transfers and bulk commodity operations. It also transports chemicals, agricultural and food products, minerals, automotive, forest products, fertilizers, and metals and equipment; and coal, coke, and iron ore to electricity-generating power plants, steel manufacturers, and industrial plants, as well as exports coal to deep-water port facilities. In addition, the company provides intermodal services through a network of approximately 30 terminals transporting manufactured consumer goods in containers; and drayage services, including the pickup and delivery of intermodal shipments. It serves the automotive industry with distribution centers and storage locations, as well as connects non-rail served customers through transferring products, such as plastics and ethanol from rail to trucks. The company operates approximately 20,000 route mile rail network, which serves various population centers in 26 states east of the Mississippi River, the District of Columbia, and the Canadian provinces of Ontario and Quebec, as well as owns 3400 locomotives","summary_zh":"CSX Corporation 及其子公司在美國和加拿大提供鐵路貨運服務。它透過兩個部門運作：鐵路和卡車運輸。該公司提供鐵路服務；多式聯運貨櫃和拖車的運輸，以及其他運輸服務，例如鐵路到卡車轉運和大宗商品運營。它還運輸化學品、農產品和食品、礦物、汽車、林產品、化肥、金屬和設備；煤炭、焦炭和鐵礦石供應給發電廠、鋼鐵製造商和工廠，並向深水港口設施出口煤炭。此外，該公司還透過由約 30 個碼頭組成的網路提供多式聯運服務，以貨櫃運輸製成消費品；拖運服務，包括多式聯運貨物的提貨和交付。它透過配送中心和儲存地點為汽車產業提供服務，並透過將塑膠和乙醇等產品從鐵路轉移到卡車來連接非鐵路服務的客戶。該公司經營約 20,000 英里的鐵路網路，為密西西比河以東 26 個州、哥倫比亞特區以及加拿大安大略省和魁北克省的各個人口中心提供服務，並擁有 3400 輛機車","sector_zh":"工業","industry_zh":"鐵路","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":32.16,"h":32.3,"l":31.96,"c":32.19,"v":10978700},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":32.15,"h":32.28,"l":31.91,"c":32.28,"v":18564700},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":32.23,"h":32.7,"l":32.05,"c":32.66,"v":10947600},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":32.61,"h":32.76,"l":32.17,"c":32.53,"v":9677400},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":32.5,"h":32.58,"l":32.0,"c":32.43,"v":16025700},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":32.37,"h":32.52,"l":32.19,"c":32.2,"v":9822600},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":32.07,"h":32.34,"l":31.8,"c":32.05,"v":8497200},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":32.03,"h":32.89,"l":31.96,"c":32.85,"v":10280200},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":32.74,"h":32.9,"l":32.45,"c":32.47,"v":9255300},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":32.56,"h":32.71,"l":32.18,"c":32.5,"v":7725100},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":32.59,"h":32.81,"l":32.41,"c":32.47,"v":12186400},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":32.54,"h":33.07,"l":32.48,"c":32.77,"v":11842700},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":33.11,"h":33.57,"l":32.71,"c":33.43,"v":14664500},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":33.51,"h":33.59,"l":32.89,"c":32.98,"v":27076300},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":32.98,"h":33.46,"l":32.84,"c":33.2,"v":22445000},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":33.35,"h":34.32,"l":33.3,"c":34.07,"v":27739500},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":33.91,"h":34.3,"l":33.46,"c":33.82,"v":13993500},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":34.04,"h":34.22,"l":33.71,"c":33.78,"v":20535900},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":33.78,"h":34.11,"l":33.58,"c":34.01,"v":12939900},{"t":"2025-