WZVSE1lX1ZSSDdjUU9mYnFuTnFEbDhtM19pdmFxWXF2eEJfRkFOeVUxZUExZjZGX2p1aTZsMTBtN2d6UmFSaWd4SGRzLUJRaEVlMktxRENmbG9FZ2NhM3dPWjZNUDRDdW1lc3pnQVE?oc=5","date":"2026-10-22","zh":"CSX 飆升 7%，創紀錄的收入和上調的指引帶來“強勁的盈利增長”"},{"title":"CSX Q3 Earnings Beat Estimates on Higher Volumes and Pricing","src":"TradingView","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxNeWJoZkVEcFZHS2I3eDNtdW83djVYeWdxM0lyX0dQVnNKS0gzVmVSTDlsb0llUmVOalB0a2F0OW1MQmtiQWtOczk1LUg5alJGTVVJYmtzMkM3RTg2bFcwcm1uM0E5RFhYQWxSQlRoOG4yM25oNmdKWFRZTkFrU3BOeGNyY0RpOEpTVU5pV0N4S1JPYzhIZ3NmZS1rQnBreUtNRkZiT0twaGRUaUNwQ2dKYkdOSTQ4QQ?oc=5","date":"2026-10-22","zh":"CSX 第三季收益因產量和定價增加而超出預期"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":5},{"name":"訂單/合約","count":2},{"name":"併購","count":1},{"name":"分析師評等","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-12","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/277948/000027794826000006/csx-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"CSX Corporation, together with its subsidiaries (\"CSX\" or the \"Company\"), based in Jacksonville, Florida, is one of the nation's leading transportation companies. The Company provides rail-based freight transportation services including traditional rail service, the transport of intermodal containers and trailers, as well as other transportation services such as rail-to-truck transfers and bulk commodity operations. CSX and the rail industry provide customers with access to an expansive and interconnected transportation network that plays a key role in North American commerce and is critical to the long-term economic success and improved global competitiveness of the United States. In addition, freight railroads provide the most economical and environmentally efficient means to transport goods over land.","zh":"總部位於佛羅裡達州傑克遜維爾的 CSX Corporation 及其子公司（「CSX」或「公司」）是美國領先的運輸公司之一。該公司提供基於鐵路的貨運服務，包括傳統的鐵路服務、多式聯運貨櫃和拖車的運輸，以及其他運輸服務，例如鐵車轉運和大宗商品運營。 CSX 和鐵路行業為客戶提供了廣闊且互聯的運輸網路，該網路在北美商業中發揮關鍵作用，對於美國的長期經濟成功和提高全球競爭力至關重要。此外，貨運鐵路提供了最經濟、最環保的陸上貨物運輸方式。"},{"en":"CSX's principal operating subsidiary, CSX Transportation, Inc. (\"CSXT\"), provides an important link to the transportation supply chain through its approximately 20,000 route-mile rail network and serves major population centers in 26 states east of the Mississippi River, the District of Columbia and the Canadian provinces of Ontario and Quebec. It has access to over 70 ocean, river and lake port terminals along the Atlantic and Gulf Coasts, the Mississippi River, the Great Lakes and the St. Lawrence Seaway. This access allows the Company to meet the dynamic transportation needs of manufacturers, industrial producers, the automotive industry, construction companies, farmers and feed mills, wholesalers and retailers, and energy producers. The Company's intermodal business links customers to railroads via trucks and terminals. CSXT also serves thousands of production and distribution facili","zh":"CSX 的主要營運子公司 CSX Transportation, Inc.（「CSXT」）透過其約 20,000 英里的鐵路網路提供了與運輸供應鏈的重要聯繫，並為密西西比河以東 26 個州、哥倫比亞特區以及加拿大安大略省和魁北克省的主要人口中心提供服務。它可通往大西洋和墨西哥灣沿岸、密西西比河、五大湖和聖勞倫斯海道沿線的 70 多個海洋、河流和湖泊港口碼頭。這種訪問使公司能夠滿足製造商、工業生產商、汽車行業、建築公司、農民和飼料廠、批發商和零售商以及能源生產商的動態運輸需求。該公司的多式聯運業務透過卡車和碼頭將客戶與鐵路連接起來。 CSXT 也為數千個生產和分銷設施提供服務"},{"en":"CSXT is also responsible for the Company's real estate sales, leasing, acquisition and management and development activities. Substantially all of these activities are focused on supporting railroad operations.","zh":"CSXT也負責公司的房地產銷售、租賃、收購以及管理和開發活動。基本上所有這些活動都集中在支持鐵路運營。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"The intermodal business shipped 3.0 million units (48% of volume) and generated $2.1 billion in revenue (15% of revenue) in 2025. The intermodal business combines the superior economics of rail transportation with the flexibility of trucks and offers a cost and environmental advantage over long-haul trucking. Through a network of approximately 30 terminals, the intermodal business serves all major markets east of the Mississippi River and transports mainly manufactured consumer goods in containers, providing customers with truck-like service for longer shipments.","zh":"到 2025 年，多式聯運業務的出貨量為 300 萬件（佔總量的 48%），營收為 21 億美元（佔營收的 15%）。多式聯運業務將鐵路運輸的卓越經濟性與卡車的靈活性相結合，相比長途卡車運輸具有成本和環境優勢。這家多式聯運業務透過約 30 個碼頭組成的網路，服務於密西西比河以東的所有主要市場，主要以貨櫃運輸製成品消費品，為客戶提供類似卡車的長途運輸服務。"}],"competition":[{"en":"The business environment in which the Company operates is highly competitive. Shippers typically select transportation providers that offer the most compelling combination of service and price. Service requirements, both in terms of transit time and reliability, vary by shipper and commodity. As a result, the Company's primary competition varies by commodity, geographic location and mode of available transportation and includes other railroads, motor carriers that operate similar routes across its service area and, to a less significant extent, barges, ships and pipelines.","zh":"本公司所處的經營環境競爭激烈。托運人通常選擇提供最具吸引力的服務和價格組合的運輸提供者。運輸時間和可靠性方面的服務要求因托運人和商品而異。因此，該公司的主要競爭因商品、地理位置和可用運輸方式而異，包括其他鐵路、在其服務區域內運營類似路線的汽車運輸公司，以及較小程度的駁船、船舶和管道。"},{"en":"CSXT's primary rail competitor is Norfolk Southern Railway, which operates throughout much of the Company's territory. During 2025, Norfolk Southern Railway entered into an agreement to merge with Union Pacific Railroad to form the nation's only transcontinental rail network, which requires the approval of the Surface Transportation Board. Other railroads also operate in parts of the Company's territory. Depending on the specific market, competing railroads and deregulated motor carriers may exert pressure on price and service levels. For further discussion on the risk of competition to the Company, see","zh":"CSXT 的主要鐵路競爭對手是諾福克南方鐵路，該鐵路在該公司的大部分領土上運作。 2025 年期間，諾福克南方鐵路公司與聯合太平洋鐵路公司達成協議，組成美國唯一的橫貫大陸鐵路網路，該協議需要得到地面運輸委員會的批准。其他鐵路也在該公司的部分領土上運作。根據具體市場，競爭的鐵路和放鬆管制的汽車運輸公司可能會對價格和服務水準施加壓力。有關公司競爭風險的進一步討論，請參見"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Rail","val":13276000000,"zh":"鐵路段"},{"name":"Trucking","val":839000000,"zh":"貨運部門"}],"total":14100000000},"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Total Merchandise","val":8800000000,"zh":"商品總數"},{"name":"Chemicals","val":2776000000,"zh":"化學品"},{"name":"Intermodal","val":2100000000,"zh":"聯運"},{"name":"Coal Services","val":1900000000,"zh":"煤炭服務"},{"name":"Agriculturaland Food Products","val":1618000000,"zh":"農產品及食品"},{"name":"Automotive","val":1182000000,"zh":"汽車"},{"name":"Forest Products","val":975000000,"zh":"林產品"},{"name":"Metalsand Equipment","val":869000000,"zh":"金屬砂設備"},{"name":"Minerals","val":832000000,"zh":"礦物質"},{"name":"Trucking","val":816000000,"zh":"卡車運輸"}],"total":14100000000}},"peers":["NSC","UNP","CNI","CP","DE"]}}